@page "/help"

<PageTitle>SocialPoster - Help</PageTitle>

<h1>Help</h1>
<MudPaper Class="pa-4" Outlined="true">
    <ul>
        <li>Manage Bluesky, X, LinkedIn and Mastodon accounts in Accounts &amp; settings.</li>
        <li>In Links, enter a destination and optional custom shortcode, then choose Save and compose.</li>
        <li>Compose on an existing link keeps its shortcode and metadata and adds it to your draft.</li>
        <li>Use Compose &amp; schedule for AI drafting, publishing and scheduling with SocialPoster.</li>
        <li>Sign in with Microsoft Entra using the configured tenant and administrator account.</li>
        <li>The application grants the <b>admin</b> role only to the configured administrator object ID. SWA role
            invitations are no longer used.
        </li>
    </ul>
</MudPaper>
